      "response": {
        "content": "REQ-1 is done. The purchase order PO-0001 is confirmed for 100 units of W-100 from S-1 at 5.67 USD per unit, 567.00 USD in total, charged to CC-OPS.\n\nMy first order attempt at S-1's original quote of 5.40 failed with a precondition error. When I re-read the quote, S-1 had raised its price to 5.67. That is still under the 6.00 cap and still cheaper than S-2's 5.75, so I resubmitted at 5.67.\n\nThe order fits the CC-OPS budget: 20,000 of the 100,000 limit (minor units) was already committed before this order. I submitted the final report with one claim for REQ-1, marked done and citing PO-0001.",
